{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model with scvi_n200 encoder and multiprofile setting, achieving validation accuracy of 0.650124 (vs 0.520276 in singleprofile with scvi_n200). Validation F1 of 0.627507 supports this improvement, suggesting multiprofile may enhance performance. However, the role of aggregation (avgpool) and other design choices remains uncertain, as multimodal components were not tested."
}

